(* Scout "conversation": Oracle7's conversation conversion layer (runtime AO,
   the M53 meta-fold; the released head carries the same shape as w529 over
   chat_context_v2) as a HOL object: a datatype of constructions, the rewrite
   as a function over dialogue state, and the two properties the AO docstring
   claims - a rewrite never answers by itself, and a probe leaves state
   unchanged. No arithmetic beyond numerals, so one session, no base. *)
session Veri7vn_Converse = HOL +
  options [document = false, threads = 2]
  sessions
    "HOL-Library"
  theories
    Converse
    Converse_Export
